  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"In memory of Eric Garner. In response to the continuation of racist violence in the U.S. and around the world. 2014 Levi Sherman."</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Book unfolds eleven times, the same number of times Eric Garner was filmed while held in a choke hold telling police he couldn't breathe. As the book opens, images of Garner appear on the left, and the phrase "I can't breathe" appears on the right, becoming larger and blurry.</subfield>
